        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Gift cover, fukusa, of green silk embroidered with orange, grey, black and brown silk and silver and gold thread in satin stitch, couched work and knots. Lined with orange silk.\n\nThe embroidered decoration depicts a crane in flight above golden waves. The crane's head is down, and orange and white wings are forming a semi-circle."@en ;
